  "end": 292.72
 },
 {
  "en": "Okeydoke.",
  "start": 292.76,
  "end": 294.47
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you lost already, Teodoro?",
  "start": 308.17,
  "end": 310.83
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 310.86,
  "end": 312.48
 },
 {
  "en": "But you are.",
  "start": 314.48,
  "end": 316.44
 },
 {
  "en": "This is my room now.",
  "start": 347.39,
  "end": 349.82
 },
 {
  "en": "You're done in here.",
  "start": 353.46,
  "end": 355.71
 },
 {
  "en": "If you had gone after Scofield today, all would have been forgiven.",
  "start": 355.81,
  "end": 359.31
 },
 {
  "en": "This is suicide.",
  "start": 359.35,
  "end": 360.27
 },
 {
  "en": "Shut up, old man!",
  "start": 360.32,
  "end": 362.05
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll take my chances.",
  "start": 363.5,
  "end": 365.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah. You think you can run Sona?",
  "start": 365.03,
  "end": 368.13
 },
 {
  "en": "You couldn't even run shipments from one dock to the other, but I still keep you by my side.",
  "start": 368.17,
  "end": 374.38
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll let you walk out of here out of respect for what you were.",
  "start": 378.37,
  "end": 382.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on!",
  "start": 384.01,
  "end": 385.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Get the hell out of here!",
  "start": 387.97,
  "end": 390.62
 },
 {
  "en": "All of you ready to do this?",
  "start": 397.37,
  "end": 400.07
 },
 {
  "en": "Until Lechero gets back, we should start looking for pieces about 4 feet in length.",
  "start": 404.38,
  "end": 409.57
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm running things now!",
  "start": 443.06,
  "end": 445.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Anyone got a problem with that?",
  "start": 447.45,
  "end": 450.96
 },
 {
  "en": "Come get it!",
  "start": 452.07,
  "end": 454.78
 },
 {
  "en": "Good.",
  "start": 462.1,
  "end": 464.01
 },
 {
  "en": "First order of business, A case of rum to the man who brings me Michael Scofield!",
  "start": 464.68,
  "end": 471.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't worry We'll be there with all the cash",
  "start": 507.47,
  "end": 510.27
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay? Gracias.",
  "start": 510.28,
  "end": 512.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Osberto.",
  "start": 513.17,
  "end": 514.88
 },
 {
  "en": "That's who you want to talk to.",
  "start": 514.92,
  "end": 516.44
 },
 {
  "en": "This guy on the up-and-up?",
  "start": 516.48,
  "end": 518.04
 },
 {
  "en": "The guy I was running things into Sona for arranged this, so it's as up as it's gonna get for this kind of deal.",
  "start": 518.05,
  "end": 522.11
 },
 {
  "en": "So, yes.",
  "start": 522.13,
  "end": 523.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Osberto doesn't speak English, though, so how do you want to work it?",
  "start": 523.99,
  "end": 527.02
 },
 {
  "en": "I need to meet with Susan.",
  "start": 527.06,
  "end": 528.55
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll take Sofia. She can translate for me.",
  "start": 528.58,
  "end": 530.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't worry about it.",
  "start": 530.04,
  "end": 531.71
 },
 {
  "en": "So when I meet with Susan, what do you want me to tell her?",
  "start": 532.34,
  "end": 536.06
 },
 {
  "en": "Tell her whatever you think she wants to hear.",
  "start": 536.11,
  "end": 537.73
 },
 {
  "en": "Just buy us enough time to do our thing, all right?",
  "start": 537.77,
  "end": 540.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Home stretch, papi.",
  "start": 540.27,
  "end": 541.62
 },
 {
  "en": "Listen, man. I want to thank you for everything.",
  "start": 541.66,
  "end": 542.97
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, Linc, please.",
  "start": 543.01,
  "end": 543.85
 },
 {
  "en": "When we get home, I got your back.",
  "start": 543.89,
  "end": 545.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Whatever you need, whatever you want.",
  "start": 545.58,
  "end": 547.38
 },
 {
  "en": "That won't be necessary.",
  "start": 547.39,
  "end": 549.07
 },
 {
  "en": "When I'm back home, I'm a saint.",
  "start": 549.1,
  "end": 551.74
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not even jaywalking.",
  "start": 551.77,
  "end": 554.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Osberto. Don't forget.",
  "start": 554.39,
  "end": 555.95
 },
 {
  "en": "Osberto.",
  "start": 555.99,
  "end": 557.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Scofield steps outside that tunnel, he's a dead man.",
  "start": 577.87,
  "end": 581.39
 },
 {
  "en": "Far as I can tell, we have two options.",
  "start": 581.42,
  "end": 582.98
 },
 {
  "en": "We can invite Sammy on the escape...",
  "start": 583.03,
  "end": 585.95
 },
 {
  "en": "He can go to hell.",
  "start": 585.98,
  "end": 587.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Which brings us to option number two.",
  "start": 587.75,
  "end": 590.6
 },
 {
  "en": "You wouldn't last a second in there with sammy.",
  "start": 592.34,
  "end": 594.33
 },
 {
  "en": "Would you?",
  "start": 594.37,
  "end": 595.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Then I guess we'll just have to outsource.",
  "start": 599.57,
  "end": 603.47
 },
 {
  "en": "I felt sorry for the guy, but you don't chicken-foot an Ex-Delta force and expect to make it out alive.",
  "start": 610.29,
  "end": 616.11
 },
 {
  "en": "You're delta force?",
  "start": 616.15,
  "end": 617.53
 },
 {
  "en": "Like chuck norris?",
  "start": 617.58,
  "end": 618.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Norris? He wouldn't have made it through boot camp.",
  "start": 618.63,
  "end": 621.39
 },
 {
  "en": "Excuse me...",
  "start": 622.17,
  "end": 624.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I see you're making friends.",
  "start": 625.05,
  "end": 626.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, once you get the hang of it, this place ain't so rough.",
  "start": 626.96,
  "end": 629.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 629.42,
  "end": 630.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Too bad.",
  "start": 630.72,
  "end": 631.87
 },
 {
  "en": "Too bad what?",
  "start": 631.91,
  "end": 633.61
 },
 {
  "en": "You were right. We got a little plan going on.",
  "start": 634.79,
  "end": 637.11
 },
 {
  "en": "But, you know, if you're putting down roots...",
  "start": 637.13,
  "end": 639.08
 },
 {
  "en": "No, no.",
  "start": 639.1,
  "end": 640.22
 },
 {
  "en": "You were saying...",
  "start": 640.25,
  "end": 641.75
 },
 {
  "en": "We're supposed to be out of here in 48 hours.",
  "start": 641.78,
  "end": 645.02
 },
 {
  "en": "Not through Scofield.",
  "start": 645.06,
  "end": 646.38
 },
 {
  "en": "You heard the town cried.",
  "start": 646.42,
  "end": 647.4
 },
 {
  "en": "College boy's life is barely worth a case of booze.",
  "start": 647.44,
  "end": 650.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Hence our current conversation.",
  "start": 650.97,
  "end": 653.43
 },
 {
  "en": "I know how you got your cherry yesterday, Daubing your wraps in acetone, smothering the guy until he passed out from the fumes.",
  "start": 653.45,
  "end": 665.36
 },
 {
  "en": "You do the same thing to Sammy, and you're in.",
  "start": 665.47,
  "end": 669.23
 },
 {
  "en": "Chicken-foot Sammy?",
  "start": 669.27,
  "end": 670.19
 },
 {
  "en": "Chicken-foot Sammy.",
  "start": 670.23,
  "end": 672.46
 },
 {
  "en": "It's all riding on you, champ.",
  "start": 673.56,
  "end": 676.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Thank you.",
  "start": 691.57,
  "end": 692.82
 },
 {
  "en": "This shouldn't take long.",
  "start": 693.92,
  "end": 695.45
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you getting?",
  "start": 695.52,
  "end": 696.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Supplies.",
  "start": 696.47,
  "end": 697.65
 },
 {
  "en": "For?",
  "start": 697.69,
  "end": 698.82
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't want to get caught flat-footed again.",
  "start": 698.84,
  "end": 700.76
 },
 {
  "en": "You know what that means?",
  "start": 700.79,
  "end": 701.76
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 701.82,
  "end": 702.69
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, these people obviously have a plan.",
  "start": 702.72,
  "end": 704.4
 },
 {
  "en": "We're gonna need one, too.",
  "start": 704.43,
  "end": 705.48
 },
 {
  "en": "Does that plan include screwing over James?",
  "start": 705.51,
  "end": 708.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Is it James or Gary Miller?",
  "start": 708.6,
  "end": 709.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Whatever his name is, there's a part of me that doesn't want to believe he works for them...",
  "start": 709.75,
  "end": 714.12
 },
 {
  "en": "'cause he's the man I loved, the man who went to prison for me, the man who was going to take me to my first trip to Paris.",
  "start": 715.51,
  "end": 722.16
 },
 {
  "en": "I haven't turned my back to that man.",
  "start": 722.25,
  "end": 724.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Do I have your word that he's gonna be all right?",
  "start": 725.61,
  "end": 728.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 728.4,
  "end": 729.45
 },
 {
  "en": "Now get in.",
  "start": 729.49,
  "end": 731.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Do I have your word?!",
  "start": 731.61,
  "end": 733.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, you got my word.",
  "start": 733.26,
  "end": 736.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Now get in.",
  "start": 737.21,
  "end": 739.52
 },
 {
  "en": "You know I just found out, That \"Sucre\" means \"Sugar. \"",
  "start": 769.35,
  "end": 773.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 773.73,
  "end": 774.66
 },
 {
  "en": "So every time I say your name, I'm calling you \"Sugar. \"",
  "start": 774.7,
  "end": 779.36
 },
 {
  "en": "Basically.",
  "start": 779.83,
  "end": 781.21
 },
 {
  "en": "I like that.",
  "start": 781.24,
  "end": 783.27
 },
 {
  "en": "Look, I don't have a lot of information.",
  "start": 783.45,
  "end": 786.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Which, I guess, that's good news for you, right?",
  "start": 786.2,
  "end": 789.91
 },
 {
  "en": "You care to elaborate?",
  "start": 789.94,
  "end": 791.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Lincoln isn't cooking anything up.",
  "start": 792.11,
  "end": 794.25
 },
 {
  "en": "He's still planning on exchanging Whistler for LJ.",
  "start": 794.26,
  "end": 797.49
 },
 {
  "en": "He hasn't been talking about running any games.",
  "start": 797.53,
  "end": 800.32
 },
 {
  "en": "And did he become an eagle scout last night, too?",
  "start": 800.33,
  "end": 802.97
 },
 {
  "en": "Lady, he got the message.",
  "start": 803.01,
  "end": 804.58
 },
 {
  "en": "He knows he doesn't have a choice, he has to play it straight.",
  "start": 804.61,
  "end": 807.93
 },
 {
  "en": "Look, I could have come up here and made something up just to get paid, but...",
  "start": 810.58,
  "end": 814.45
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not trying to get on your bad side either.",
  "start": 816.15,
  "end": 818.41
 },
 {
  "en": "You know what?",
  "start": 818.45,
  "end": 820.09
 },
 {
  "en": "I believe you.",
  "start": 821.49,
  "end": 823.83
 },
 {
  "en": "So, I'll call you if anything comes up.",
  "start": 824.84,
  "end": 827.8
 },
 {
  "en": "Whoa, whoa! What am I, a toothless crack whore?",
  "start": 827.83,
  "end": 829.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Sit down.",
  "start": 829.63,
  "end": 831.41
 },
 {
  "en": "I keep my promises.",
  "start": 836.27,
  "end": 838.83
 },
 {
  "en": "People I work for, they don't like to deal in greenbacks; it's just too bulky.",
  "start": 839.38,
  "end": 844.43
 },
 {
