  "en": "15 minutes.",
  "start": 1020.17,
  "end": 1022.47
 },
 {
  "en": "I never thought I'd say this, but I envy you, Brad.",
  "start": 1033.66,
  "end": 1036.59
 },
 {
  "en": "I've wanted to shank that little calypso kid ever since I first met him.",
  "start": 1036.62,
  "end": 1039.18
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not a violent guy by nature, but if a man makes me walk around in my grunts for two days...",
