  "end": 1230.08
 },
 {
  "en": "We need that saw.",
  "start": 1234.63,
  "end": 1236.41
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, uh, I am a fisherman.",
  "start": 1236.45,
  "end": 1240.72
 },
 {
  "en": "I am.",
  "start": 1240.85,
  "end": 1241.85
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm just maybe a little bit more connected than I've let on.",
  "start": 1241.9,
  "end": 1245.94
 },
 {
  "en": "I think this is gonna work.",
  "start": 1246.8,
  "end": 1247.86
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 1247.9,
  "end": 1249.65
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, I run charters, just like I said...",
  "start": 1249.73,
  "end": 1253.03
 },
 {
  "en": "I have for years.",
  "start": 1253.07,
  "end": 1254.72
 },
 {
  "en": "Then one day, that brunette, Gretchen well, she asked me if I wanted to be exclusive to her corporation, right?",
  "start": 1254.73,
  "end": 1260.64
 },
 {
  "en": "And, uh, well, with the money she was offering, I had a pretty good idea she wasn't just trawling for salmon.",
  "start": 1260.65,
  "end": 1266.52
 },
 {
  "en": "So you two have history.",
  "start": 1266.56,
  "end": 1268.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah. And she's been an absolute nightmare in my life ever since that first job.",
  "start": 1268.14,
  "end": 1273.23
 },
 {
  "en": "Alex, I need a wedge.",
  "start": 1273.27,
  "end": 1275.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Wedge.",
  "start": 1275.48,
  "end": 1276.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Look, I took 'em where they wanted me to take 'em.",
  "start": 1276.6,
  "end": 1278.7
 },
 {
  "en": "I have to figure out these coordinates and I have to take them back there.",
  "start": 1278.71,
  "end": 1281.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Quit embarrassing yourself.",
  "start": 1281.32,
  "end": 1283.93
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 1284.15,
  "end": 1284.82
 },
 {
  "en": "We're not two chicks at a bar you're trying to pick up.",
  "start": 1284.87,
  "end": 1286.55
 },
 {
  "en": "Unless you need to hear this?",
  "start": 1286.58,
  "end": 1288.11
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 1286.58,
  "end": 1288.11
 },
 {
  "en": "All right, good.",
  "start": 1288.15,
  "end": 1288.71
 },
 {
  "en": "You work for the Company.",
  "start": 1288.73,
  "end": 1290.16
 },
 {
  "en": "And when you break out of here, you're gonna do whatever the Company asks you to do, period.",
  "start": 1290.18,
  "end": 1294.76
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, they're using me just like they're using you.",
  "start": 1294.8,
  "end": 1296.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Good, I'm glad you shared that with me.",
  "start": 1296.73,
  "end": 1297.99
 },
 {
  "en": "So why don't we go back to work?",
  "start": 1298.0,
  "end": 1299.03
 },
 {
  "en": "How's that sound?",
  "start": 1299.07,
  "end": 1300.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Let those idiots chicken foot themselves all they want, huh?",
  "start": 1308.53,
  "end": 1312.25
 },
 {
  "en": "But if one of them tries to use it on us...",
  "start": 1312.28,
  "end": 1315.49
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't have to fight that guy.",
  "start": 1316.77,
  "end": 1318.93
 },
 {
  "en": "It's my farewell tour.",
  "start": 1318.97,
  "end": 1321.2
 },
 {
  "en": "The rest of those pieces are no good.",
  "start": 1323.09,
  "end": 1324.91
 },
 {
  "en": "We're going to need those tools, Michael.",
  "start": 1324.93,
  "end": 1328.06
 },
 {
  "en": "I guess we'll just have to wait.",
  "start": 1328.94,
  "end": 1331.52
 },
 {
  "en": "That book of yours- it's just a bunch of coordinates in there, right?",
  "start": 1331.7,
  "end": 1336.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Among other things.",
  "start": 1337.14,
  "end": 1339.48
 },
 {
  "en": "So you wouldn't mind.",
  "start": 1340.09,
  "end": 1342.35
 },
 {
  "en": "It's just a bunch of, uh, numbers and dates.",
  "start": 1348.09,
  "end": 1351.61
 },
 {
  "en": "\"Gate. \"",
  "start": 1351.62,
  "end": 1352.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Gate netting company.",
  "start": 1352.84,
  "end": 1354.12
 },
 {
  "en": "That's where I rent my trams.",
  "start": 1354.13,
  "end": 1356.34
 },
 {
  "en": "\"Stampede. \"",
  "start": 1357.29,
  "end": 1358.5
 },
 {
  "en": "That's my buddy's cape islander.",
  "start": 1358.51,
  "end": 1360.14
 },
 {
  "en": "And this is important to us how?",
  "start": 1360.15,
  "end": 1361.61
 },
 {
  "en": "It's important because I'm being accused of being someone I'm not.",
  "start": 1361.62,
  "end": 1364.52
 },
 {
  "en": "And I don't want Scofield ditching me once it's time to leave...",
  "start": 1364.53,
  "end": 1366.99
 },
 {
  "en": "He's not ditching anybody.",
  "start": 1367.0,
  "end": 1368.18
 },
 {
  "en": "If he could have gotten rid of anybody, he would have gotten rid of me.",
  "start": 1368.19,
  "end": 1370.85
 },
 {
  "en": "And if he tries to leave the city he knows that we're gonna turn him in before he gets out of the city.",
  "start": 1370.86,
  "end": 1374.77
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm going upstairs to find Lechero and his equipment.",
  "start": 1374.78,
  "end": 1377.84
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm with Alex.",
  "start": 1377.85,
  "end": 1379.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you mind?",
  "start": 1380.21,
  "end": 1381.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Sounds like someone's up there.",
  "start": 1385.97,
  "end": 1388.28
 },
 {
  "en": "If Lechero gets stranded up there, we're not getting out of here.",
  "start": 1391.62,
  "end": 1393.92
 },
 {
  "en": "So when you think it's safe, or it feels like it's safe, we got to go, we got to go up.",
  "start": 1393.93,
  "end": 1399.05
 },
 {
  "en": "We've been talking about chicken footing Sammy for months.",
  "start": 1438.39,
  "end": 1441.07
 },
 {
  "en": "No one had the courage.",
  "start": 1441.08,
  "end": 1443.34
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you have any paint thinner?",
  "start": 1443.35,
  "end": 1444.52
 },
 {
  "en": "Paint thinner?",
  "start": 1444.53,
  "end": 1445.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Shoe polish, lighter fluid, glue?",
  "start": 1445.84,
  "end": 1449.37
 },
 {
  "en": "There you are, champ.",
  "start": 1451.71,
  "end": 1453.59
 },
 {
  "en": "It's time.",
  "start": 1453.6,
  "end": 1454.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Stomp his face, Brad!",
  "start": 1454.39,
  "end": 1456.18
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, this has all been one big misunderstanding.",
  "start": 1456.19,
  "end": 1458.54
 },
 {
  "en": "I wasn't talking about Sammy.",
  "start": 1458.55,
  "end": 1460.28
 },
 {
  "en": "It was... that's him.",
  "start": 1460.29,
  "end": 1462.18
 },
 {
  "en": "That's the guy I was talking about.",
  "start": 1462.19,
  "end": 1463.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, I don't see no \"fruity moustache,\" and where's his \"ugly-ass vest,\" Brad?",
  "start": 1463.68,
  "end": 1467.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't worry, you stand a real chance of winning this one.",
  "start": 1467.99,
  "end": 1471.83
 },
 {
  "en": "You cannot just hide out all day.",
  "start": 1480.19,
  "end": 1481.7
 },
 {
  "en": "What else can I do, huh?",
  "start": 1481.71,
  "end": 1484.0
 },
 {
  "en": "I've ruled these men for a year with blood.",
  "start": 1484.01,
  "end": 1485.97
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't think those men want to take the head of the man who wore the crown?",
  "start": 1485.98,
  "end": 1488.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Be that as it may, Bellick is about to lose his head to Sammy.",
  "start": 1488.45,
  "end": 1493.69
 },
 {
  "en": "You may not want to hear this, but once that happens, we are both very much aware that Scofield is gonna stop getting curious about where the hell you are.",
  "start": 1494.54,
  "end": 1501.63
 },
 {
  "en": "He's going to come crawling out of his hole and right into Sammy's arms, and then he and our escape are gone forever.",
  "start": 1501.64,
  "end": 1509.55
 },
 {
  "en": "Wait.",
  "start": 1552.99,
  "end": 1553.93
 },
 {
  "en": "We get the tools and we come straight back.",
  "start": 1553.94,
  "end": 1557.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on",
  "start": 1572.47,
  "end": 1573.57
 },
 {
  "en": "You guys want to watch the fight?",
  "start": 1610.55,
  "end": 1612.74
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, chill out.",
  "start": 1614.18,
  "end": 1615.66
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll get you a beer.",
  "start": 1615.67,
  "end": 1617.56
 },
 {
  "en": "You like that?",
  "start": 1652.21,
  "end": 1653.65
 },
 {
  "en": "Stop it!",
  "start": 1667.78,
  "end": 1669.33
 },
 {
  "en": "It's Scofield!",
  "start": 1669.72,
  "end": 1671.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Scofield's in there.",
  "start": 1684.68,
  "end": 1686.18
 },
 {
  "en": "It's locked.",
  "start": 1686.19,
  "end": 1687.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Open the door.",
  "start": 1687.06,
  "end": 1688.62
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't have the combination.",
  "start": 1688.63,
  "end": 1689.79
 },
 {
  "en": "I said... open it now.",
  "start": 1689.8,
  "end": 1692.89
 },
 {
  "en": "We can't. We can't.",
  "start": 1693.73,
  "end": 1696.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Open it now.",
  "start": 1697.41,
  "end": 1698.81
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't have the combination.",
  "start": 1698.82,
  "end": 1702.06
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, I've got your man out here.",
  "start": 1702.41,
  "end": 1705.35
 },
 {
  "en": "If you don't open the door, he's the one who's going to pay the price.",
  "start": 1705.36,
  "end": 1708.96
 },
 {
  "en": "I need him alive!",
  "start": 1709.75,
  "end": 1710.69
 },
 {
  "en": "You saw those guys.",
  "start": 1710.7,
  "end": 1711.65
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you think they've got planned?",
  "start": 1711.66,
  "end": 1713.13
 },
 {
  "en": "All of you is trying my patience.",
  "start": 1713.14,
  "end": 1715.29
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you suggest, Alex?",
  "start": 1715.3,
  "end": 1718.12
 },
 {
  "en": "Let's be ready for them.",
  "start": 1718.67,
  "end": 1721.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Time's up.",
  "start": 1722.93,
  "end": 1724.97
 },
 {
  "en": "You want another one?",
  "start": 1728.23,
  "end": 1730.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Then you better be persuasive.",
  "start": 1730.12,
  "end": 1732.86
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael.",
  "start": 1736.26,
  "end": 1738.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't open the door! He's got a gun...",
  "start": 1739.17,
  "end": 1741.64
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you going to tell me what it's for?",
  "start": 1748.26,
  "end": 1750.19
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 1750.2,
  "end": 1751.35
 },
 {
  "en": "Because you think I might tell James?",
