  "en": "Because you don't need to know.",
  "start": 1753.14,
  "end": 1755.52
 },
 {
  "en": "It's going to be all right.",
  "start": 1760.79,
  "end": 1762.64
 },
 {
  "en": "How'd it go?",
  "start": 1766.84,
  "end": 1768.35
 },
 {
  "en": "Good.",
  "start": 1766.84,
  "end": 1768.35
 },
 {
  "en": "I told her what she wanted to hear, just like you told me.",
  "start": 1768.36,
  "end": 1770.57
 },
 {
  "en": "That it?",
  "start": 1770.58,
  "end": 1772.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 1772.17,
  "end": 1773.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Cool.",
  "start": 1774.1,
  "end": 1774.76
 },
 {
  "en": "Listen, I want you to call her up, tell her you've got some information.",
  "start": 1774.77,
  "end": 1777.45
 },
 {
  "en": "Make sure she picks you up, and get in the car, all right?",
  "start": 1777.46,
  "end": 1779.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay.",
  "start": 1779.71,
  "end": 1780.45
 },
 {
  "en": "Is everything okay?",
  "start": 1780.46,
  "end": 1782.48
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah. Why?",
  "start": 1782.49,
  "end": 1783.83
 },
 {
  "en": "She looks upset.",
  "start": 1783.84,
  "end": 1785.89
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll call you later.",
  "start": 1786.98,
  "end": 1788.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Got something down here we can use, Michael.",
  "start": 1796.29,
  "end": 1799.38
 },
 {
  "en": "If they come through that door...",
  "start": 1804.73,
  "end": 1807.23
 },
 {
  "en": "You hit 'em right here.",
  "start": 1807.24,
  "end": 1809.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Go ahead, take it. Go ahead.",
  "start": 1809.05,
  "end": 1811.95
 },
 {
  "en": "It'll puncture the heart.",
  "start": 1814.11,
  "end": 1816.25
 },
 {
  "en": "You were hiding Scofield in your room?",
  "start": 1839.73,
  "end": 1841.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Look at you- the power make you mad already.",
  "start": 1841.84,
  "end": 1845.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Come along, Norman. It's cool.",
  "start": 1847.1,
  "end": 1850.04
 },
 {
  "en": "What is so urgent?",
  "start": 1878.67,
  "end": 1880.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Lincoln bought a gun.",
  "start": 1880.06,
  "end": 1881.36
 },
 {
  "en": "I... I asked him what he planned on doing with it, but he wouldn't answer.",
  "start": 1882.16,
  "end": 1885.85
 },
 {
  "en": "So I just... I just thought you might want to know.",
  "start": 1885.86,
  "end": 1889.25
 },
 {
  "en": "If anything changes, I'll get back to you, okay?",
  "start": 1889.26,
  "end": 1892.22
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, the other day when you and Lincoln had your little spat in the lobby and you all distraught and jilted- went across the street to the bar, a cynic might think that was staged.",
  "start": 1892.23,
  "end": 1906.08
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm a cynic, Sugar.",
  "start": 1908.01,
  "end": 1909.78
 },
 {
  "en": "You're high, Sugar.",
  "start": 1909.79,
  "end": 1911.61
 },
 {
  "en": "If it's any comfort, you guys almost pulled it off.",
  "start": 1911.62,
  "end": 1914.1
 },
 {
  "en": "The Puerto Rican and the gorilla- you really had me scrambling there for a minute.",
  "start": 1914.11,
  "end": 1918.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, if you don't want my help, fine, I'm out, okay?",
  "start": 1918.06,
  "end": 1920.51
 },
 {
  "en": "It's a little thing called a tracing number- on the check I gave you.",
  "start": 1920.52,
  "end": 1925.87
 },
 {
  "en": "Apparently your extensive expertise in banking failed you that day.",
  "start": 1926.31,
  "end": 1930.98
 },
 {
  "en": "You promptly wired all 25k to",
  "start": 1930.99,
  "end": 1934.02
 },
 {
  "en": "Maricruz Delgado in Chicago at 123",
  "start": 1934.03,
  "end": 1938.12
 },
 {
  "en": "\"Please don't hurt me\" Lane.",
  "start": 1938.13,
  "end": 1939.9
 },
 {
  "en": "I swear to god, if something happens to her...",
  "start": 1939.91,
  "end": 1942.29
 },
 {
  "en": "If what?!",
  "start": 1942.3,
  "end": 1942.89
 },
 {
  "en": "What, jackass?!",
  "start": 1944.38,
  "end": 1946.61
 },
 {
  "en": "You're going to go back there and you're going to get me some real information, or Maricruz and her head are going to part ways.",
  "start": 1950.1,
  "end": 1959.12
 },
 {
  "en": "Get out of my car.",
  "start": 1961.23,
  "end": 1963.69
 },
 {
  "en": "Now.",
  "start": 1964.32,
  "end": 1966.36
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, Blanco.",
  "start": 1978.61,
  "end": 1980.62
 },
 {
  "en": "I got your good buddy Lechero here.",
  "start": 1980.63,
  "end": 1982.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Why don't you give it the secret knock so he knows you, huh?",
  "start": 1982.72,
  "end": 1986.13
 },
 {
  "en": "The combination.",
  "start": 1986.88,
  "end": 1988.14
 },
 {
  "en": "What makes you think I have the combination?",
  "start": 1988.15,
  "end": 1990.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Just do what he says.",
  "start": 1990.8,
  "end": 1993.18
 },
 {
  "en": "How many times you gonna pull that little thing out?",
  "start": 1998.54,
  "end": 2000.09
 },
