  "en": "For what, getting your ass kicked?",
  "start": 2240.51,
  "end": 2242.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm in or I shout it from the rooftops.",
  "start": 2242.21,
  "end": 2245.97
 },
 {
  "en": "You're in, champ.",
  "start": 2246.9,
  "end": 2249.87
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay, you need to stay here.",
  "start": 2264.65,
  "end": 2266.16
 },
 {
  "en": "I got to get something, all right?",
  "start": 2266.17,
  "end": 2268.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't move.",
  "start": 2268.45,
  "end": 2270.24
 },
 {
  "en": "Can you get home from here?",
  "start": 2289.12,
  "end": 2290.77
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, I'm two blocks away.",
  "start": 2290.78,
  "end": 2293.32
 },
 {
  "en": "If he doesn't take you, I will.",
  "start": 2293.74,
  "end": 2296.62
 },
 {
  "en": "Here. Use this.",
  "start": 2332.84,
  "end": 2334.97
 },
 {
  "en": "Thanks.",
  "start": 2335.4,
  "end": 2337.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Right there.",
  "start": 2335.4,
  "end": 2337.1
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, for all the times you wanted me to prove I was a fisherman, I should have been asking if you were a real engineer.",
  "start": 2340.28,
  "end": 2348.21
 },
 {
  "en": "That could've been one of us buried down there.",
  "start": 2348.77,
  "end": 2350.26
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll do better next time.",
  "start": 2350.27,
  "end": 2353.08
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm gonna go back down and try to salvage some of those braces.",
  "start": 2355.15,
  "end": 2357.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, I'll go with you.",
  "start": 2357.68,
  "end": 2360.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Never gets any easier.",
  "start": 2394.5,
  "end": 2397.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Scofield, visita.",
  "start": 2404.3,
  "end": 2406.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Scofield, you have a visitor.",
  "start": 2407.22,
  "end": 2409.88
 },
 {
  "en": "All the side jobs I do at Sona for 3 years.",
  "start": 2415.59,
  "end": 2417.89
 },
 {
  "en": "I save all of my money.",
  "start": 2417.9,
  "end": 2420.03
 },
 {
  "en": "It's $173.",
  "start": 2420.04,
  "end": 2422.85
 },
 {
  "en": "If you're really leaving, it's yours.",
  "start": 2424.76,
  "end": 2428.53
 },
 {
  "en": "Take me with you. Please?",
  "start": 2428.54,
  "end": 2431.61
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't want to be here anymore.",
  "start": 2431.62,
  "end": 2434.0
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't want any part of this.",
  "start": 2435.1,
  "end": 2437.96
 },
 {
  "en": "You got a plan or are we back to square one?",
  "start": 2553.01,
  "end": 2555.29
 },
 {
  "en": "I have a plan.",
  "start": 2555.3,
  "end": 2556.47
 },
 {
  "en": "Good,'cause I got something cooking on the outside.",
  "start": 2556.48,
  "end": 2558.6
 },
 {
  "en": "I ain't walking into a buzzsaw again.",
  "start": 2558.61,
  "end": 2561.16
 },
 {
  "en": "How you dealing with the animals in here?",
  "start": 2561.93,
  "end": 2563.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Actually, it's starting to feel like home.",
  "start": 2563.45,
  "end": 2566.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Whistler still pretending he's a fisherman and all this?",
  "start": 2566.99,
  "end": 2568.87
 },
 {
  "en": "Why?",
  "start": 2568.88,
  "end": 2569.58
 },
 {
  "en": "Sofia found a passport in one of the apartments he kept.",
  "start": 2569.59,
  "end": 2572.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Name's Gary Miller.",
  "start": 2572.18,
  "end": 2573.45
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm shocked.",
  "start": 2573.46,
  "end": 2574.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Guy's a fraud, Michael.",
  "start": 2574.18,
  "end": 2575.51
 },
 {
  "en": "As far as I know, there ain't fish in Scottsdale.",
  "start": 2575.52,
  "end": 2578.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, if he's not a fisherman...",
  "start": 2584.6,
  "end": 2587.35
 },
 {
  "en": "What is he?",
  "start": 2589.1,
  "end": 2589.99
 }
